    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "wrUFH",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 11977,
      "name": "05 / OSS · 目录更新时间扫描交互说明",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 4208,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JJ1f1",
          "name": "扫描说明 0",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "目录更新时间扫描",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "m3NJT3",
          "name": "扫描说明 1",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "点击「获取更新时间并排序」，扫描当前目录及所有子目录；文件夹时间取目录内（含子目录）文件的最近更新时间。",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Mhzrv",
          "name": "扫描说明 2",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "扫描中显示累计文件数并提供「取消」；总量未知，不显示百分比。取消后保留原列表顺序，不用未完成结果排序。",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hrdDj",
          "name": "扫描说明 3",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "扫描超过 10,000 个文件时暂停，显示「文件较多，继续扫描可能耗时较长」；「继续」恢复本次扫描，「取消」结束扫描。",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "D7TxN",
          "name": "扫描说明 4",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "完成后显示「扫描完成，已按目录内最近更新时间排序」；底部「已加载」仅表示当前列表数量，与递归扫描数量分开。",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
