          "content": "最近打开：显示此设备的最近五个实例与上次打开时间，点击返回实例页；不把打开页面等同于远程连接成功。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Oy7nD",
          "name": "首次使用",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "首次使用：最近记录为空时显示引导；添加实例与本地终端按钮复用侧栏入口。删除实例隐藏旧记录，改名后显示当前名称。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qXrVI",
          "name": "关于",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "关于：完整展示 GitHub 地址并在默认浏览器打开。作者 BenLampson，Apache 2.0；全部界面文案使用中英文资源，明暗主题同步切换。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pE1qY",
          "name": "自适应",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "自适应：窄窗口隐藏首页大图标，统计卡片换行，正文与最近列表纵向滚动；保留标题栏品牌标志。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
