        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "mg7Yp",
          "name": "分区与布局",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "q5AKI",
              "name": "分区与布局标题",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "分区与布局",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "hs3mM",
              "name": "分区与布局说明",
              "fill": "$muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "引用 XOpCH 与共享控件。普通窗口实例栏默认200px，Redis键树默认280px、可拖动到280–480px；数据区至少420px。工作区工具栏56px、状态栏28px。窄窗口沿用折叠实例栏和单栏切换，不增加导航列。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "gGrzR",
          "name": "键扫描与查找",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "g1mlw",
              "name": "键扫描与查找标题",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "键扫描与查找",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "D5gQi",
              "name": "键扫描与查找说明",
              "fill": "$muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "默认键树；首次仅做有界根级发现，展开分组才按前缀分批扫描子项，每个节点保留自己的游标。零匹配批次不代表扫描结束；遇到预算暂停可继续查找。完整键直接读取保持独立，切库 / 改查询 / 关闭丢弃迟到结果。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "mjTDu",
          "name": "数量与 Cluster",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pgmSg",
              "name": "数量与 Cluster标题",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "数量与 Cluster",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "IIPwk",
              "name": "数量与 Cluster说明",
              "fill": "$muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "树中的数量仅代表已加载键，未展开分支不显示虚构总数。数据库选择器另用 DBSIZE 读取 DB 键数量；权限不足或节点不可达显示不可用，不能显示为 0。Cluster 汇总当前主节点，仅 DB 0 可选。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Z1IQq",
          "name": "取值与表示",
