        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O6CB2",
          "name": "02 · 初期连接范围 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "MySQL classic TCP 单服务端连接，默认端口 3306。数据库账号与密码、可选默认数据库、直连或 SSH 隧道。MariaDB、集群自动发现与 SQL 内容工作区另行设计。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "raTtz",
          "name": "03 · TLS 与客户端证书",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "03 · TLS 与客户端证书",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d6SIZp",
          "name": "03 · TLS 与客户端证书 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "默认 VerifyFull。信任来源：Windows 或自定义 CA。可选 PFX 客户端证书与密码。TLS 模式下拉：验证证书与主机名 / 仅加密（不验证身份）/ 禁用；后两者须显示完整风险提示，不自动降级。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UOjgF",
          "name": "04 · 路由与主机身份",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "04 · 路由与主机身份",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sI5NZ",
          "name": "04 · 路由与主机身份 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "SSH 使用既有协议模块与完整主机指纹确认，支持密码 / 私钥 / SSH Agent。数据库地址由 SSH 端访问；TLS 对数据库逻辑主机名验签。主机身份变化阻断连接。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "W6vZHW",
          "name": "05 · 测试与回退",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "05 · 测试与回退",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "P4J0ks",
          "name": "05 · 测试与回退 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "依次检查路由、TLS、账号、默认数据库。默认数据库留空时不要求访问任意业务库。认证成功不等于拥有全部权限；不为测试写入数据。不通过不能下一步。修改连接字段清空测试结果，标签或保存位置变动保留结果。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "b9ySsW",
          "name": "06 · 保存与同步",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "06 · 保存与同步",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "i127K",
          "name": "06 · 保存与同步 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "沿用现有 SQLite 配置、凭据保护与账号加密同步。未登录默认本地，可登录后返回。标签仅最后一步，复用 gKl7m / ueb2n 草稿确认。保存中禁重复提交，失败保留全部输入，成功按稳定实例 ID 加入列表。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AEPW8",
          "name": "07 · 键盘与国际化",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "07 · 键盘与国际化",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "BVdRw",
          "name": "07 · 键盘与国际化 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tab 按表单顺序移动；Enter 验证当前步骤；Escape 先关浮层，测试中可取消。密码眼睛具有本地化标签。en / zh-Hans 文案进入共享资源；英语回退、占位符等值；数据库名、账号、主机与指纹保持原样。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
