      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vThAT",
          "name": "说明标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Workspace / 组件与职责",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zSg6B",
          "name": "01 · 应用框架",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "01 · 应用框架",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ENk6z",
          "name": "01 · 应用框架 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "App Shell / rvKLh / HfFtU 管理标题栏、外层实例页签、实例列表、主题与折叠导航。MySQL 只提供 Content slot，不能另建整套主框架。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ub2Hw",
          "name": "02 · 内容组件",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "02 · 内容组件",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LjfZd",
          "name": "02 · 内容组件 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "MySQL Workspace 复用 shared ui/button、textbox、select、icon-button。Object Tree、Object Tabs、SQL Panel、Query Result Grid 是可复用组件；字段编辑窗口继承公共子窗口，短值编辑使用共享 TextBox。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lcNCP",
          "name": "03 · 真实树层级",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "03 · 真实树层级",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VIm6A",
          "name": "03 · 真实树层级 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "数据库 → 表 / 视图 / 存储过程 / 函数 / 事件；表 → 列 / 索引 / 外键 / 触发器 → 元数据项。视图可展开列；例程可展开参数。分类节点不会作为数据库对象执行。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n48NB6",
          "name": "04 · 点击与激活",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "04 · 点击与激活",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uLyDM",
          "name": "04 · 点击与激活 正文",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "箭头 / 左右键负责展开收起；单击对象打开或激活标签。表子项定位到对应结构区，不重复开一个同表标签。对象标签按实例 ID、数据库、类型、原始名称去重。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "a1VDw",
          "name": "05 · 查询上下文",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "05 · 查询上下文",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
