    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "t4uMU",
      "x": 32110,
      "y": 33802,
      "name": "09E / Redis · 弹窗与数据库选择实现契约",
      "width": 2600,
      "height": 650,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "cornerRadius": 8,
      "stroke": "$line",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "z5ImO9",
          "name": "09E 实现契约标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Redis / 弹窗编辑与数据库数量 · 实现契约",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "SMOeO",
          "name": "公共组件与尺寸 标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "公共组件与尺寸",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AIPzF",
          "name": "公共组件与尺寸 说明",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "创建默认 640×720（最小 540×560），编辑默认 780×700（最小 560×520）。复用 A9dYYr 公共子窗口，标题栏36px、固定操作栏60px，字段、下拉框、按钮与代码/集合编辑器沿用公共主题。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "g7XsCH",
          "name": "内容页与键标签 标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "内容页与键标签",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NfBfD",
          "name": "内容页与键标签 说明",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "键树懒加载，无复选框。点击键打开独立页签，按实际宽度中间省略并保留有区分度后缀，完整键名用于提示及可访问名称。内容页只读；编辑或追加打开显示完整目标的模态弹窗。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H7eZB",
          "name": "创建与完整初始值 标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "创建与完整初始值",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "U1AvIv",
          "name": "创建与完整初始值 说明",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "String 支持文本、JSON、Hex、Base64；集合支持文本/Base64和增删行。Hash / Stream 的字段名唯一且不能为空；List有序；Set/ZSet成员唯一，ZSet分数为有限数字。集合至少一个初始项。TTL 为永久或正整数秒。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FucaM",
          "name": "提交与失败恢复 标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "提交与失败恢复",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xWSw2",
          "name": "提交与失败恢复 说明",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "仅在键不存在时创建，值与 TTL 同一脚本，权限预检查；成功打开新键标签、定位树节点并刷新数量。编辑校对有界完整基线，保留服务器当前到期时间。校验、同名冲突、保存冲突、断线保留输入；结果未知时锁定重复提交并先查看目标键。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gSfGs",
          "name": "数据库标签、范围与计数 标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "数据库标签、范围与计数",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pF3iA",
          "name": "数据库标签、范围与计数 说明",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "数据库 / Database 标签与下拉框横向排列，总宽230px、高32px，位于56px工具栏。选项为 DB {0} ({1})；DBSIZE读取数量，不可读取显示不可用 / Unavailable。数量独立于已加载树节点；Cluster仅DB0。刷新数量保留选择，不重复切库。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QpeKK",
          "name": "关闭与键盘 标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "关闭与键盘",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Q7Vtia",
          "name": "关闭与键盘 说明",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "弹窗有草稿时关闭提供保存 / 放弃 / 继续编辑；保存失败仍停留，保存期间禁重复提交和关闭。Ctrl+S 提交当前弹窗。内容页标签切换、查询、读取不自动提交写操作。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "CaCwX",
          "name": "国际化与真实元数据 标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "国际化与真实元数据",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "GMWFW",
          "name": "国际化与真实元数据 说明",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "页面、占位、菜单、验证、安全错误和辅助功能由中英共享资源提供；缺译回退英语。键名、数据和协议类型不翻译。Redis不提供通用键创建时间，元数据不虚构添加时间，仅显示可读取的TTL等信息。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WUd8C",
          "name": "验证与交付 标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "验证与交付",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LGK24",
          "name": "验证与交付 说明",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "本轮仅修改 Pencil 设计，不修改代码或运行协议测试。验收包含中文浅色、英文深色、普通与窄窗口、字段编辑与创建弹窗。实现阶段另验证资源、键盘、缩放、布局和绑定；设计截图不入 Git。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
