    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "RA8yE",
      "x": 13910,
      "y": 44172,
      "name": "10B / MySQL · 表格视觉、类型图标与滚动契约",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 1060,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "cornerRadius": 8,
      "stroke": "$line",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 14,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "XBDDM",
          "name": "说明标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Grid / 类型与滚动规范",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iJ9js",
          "name": "类型图标",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "类型图标",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TchJy",
          "name": "类型图标 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "数据库 database；表 table-2；视图 eye；存储过程 workflow；函数 square-function；事件 clock-3；列 columns-3；索引 key-round；外键 link；触发器 zap。分类与叶对象使用同一类图标，展开箭头独立。颜色为辅助，不能只靠颜色区分。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eM66q",
          "name": "视觉尺寸",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "视觉尺寸",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "f7Q4C",
          "name": "视觉尺寸 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "结果表 44px 列头 / 36px 数据行 / 44px 固定行号。双层列头显示原始列名与协议数据类型；表格主体使用清晰的水平及细竖分隔，活动单元格有焦点边框，NULL 使用独立标记。数字右对齐，文本左对齐。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LWFgy",
          "name": "横向滚动",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "横向滚动",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "B42ESI",
          "name": "横向滚动 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "列不被压成等宽窄格：最小 80px，初始宽度按数据类型和有界样本计算，初始上限 400px，可拖动 / 双击列边缘调整。总列宽超过视口时显示水平滚动条，范围由总宽度减可视宽度得出。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "z4Gbhx",
          "name": "固定与同步",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "固定与同步",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "x7pkvB",
          "name": "固定与同步 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "横向滚动表头与数据使用同一偏移；固定行号不横移。纵向滚动固定表头，行号与数据同步纵移。水平滚动条位于表格底部，不被结果信息或固定行号盖住；滚动条交汇角保留独立区域。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ojOB9",
          "name": "多列与大结果",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "多列与大结果",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zFM7m",
          "name": "多列与大结果 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "行 / 列虚拟化，加载行数和内容总宽度不能由当前可见列推断。SQL 列允许同名，按结果序号而非列名识别；重复别名与表达式均保留。列顺序、宽度、选区与滚动偏移按结果集独立保存。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NcOYA",
          "name": "单元格与查看",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "单元格与查看",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IOzOL",
          "name": "单元格与查看 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "表格单行显示长值并省略，悬停或展开窗口读取完整内容。复制取原始值，不能复制省略显示文本。空串、NULL、BINARY 与未完整加载值不同；选中不等于允许写入。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H1Di3",
          "name": "滚轮与键盘",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "滚轮与键盘",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VBS8C",
          "name": "滚轮与键盘 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "鼠标 / 触控板可横向滚动，Shift+滚轮用于横向。Home / End 按当前网格范围移动，PageUp / PageDown 纵向；焦点单元格离开视口时自动滚入。列调整与滚动条具备本地化辅助功能标签。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ghy5I",
          "name": "设计对照",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "设计对照",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DpcdA",
          "name": "设计对照 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "22：多列起始位置；23：向右滚动的深色稿；24：短值内联；25–27：JSON / NULL / 二进制窗口；28–30：草稿与保存反馈；31：完整类型图标；32：可定位 SQL 字段；33：JSON 校验失败。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "KVCRc",
      "x": 15310,
      "y": 44172,
      "name": "10B / MySQL · 单元格编辑与字段窗口契约",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 1060,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "cornerRadius": 8,
      "stroke": "$line",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 14,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uuf41",
          "name": "说明标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Editing / 表格内联与字段窗口",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "aeOZA",
          "name": "短值内联",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "短值内联",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WeUik",
          "name": "短值内联 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "双击 / F2 在当前单元格编辑。Enter 接受到本地草稿，Tab 接受到草稿后移到下一可编辑格，Escape 取消当前格编辑。值或类型无效时保持编辑器并就地显示错误。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Hm013",
          "name": "独立字段窗口",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "独立字段窗口",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "OfNh9",
          "name": "独立字段窗口 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "选中 / 悬停单元格右侧显示 maximize-2 展开按钮；右键菜单也提供编辑字段值 / 查看完整值。窗口标题明确实例、表、主键、字段和类型，可调整尺寸 / 最大化，不能误操作整列或整行。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Iv169",
          "name": "应用与提交",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "应用与提交",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "K1KkrY",
          "name": "应用与提交 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "字段窗口中的应用到表格只更新此单元格草稿并关闭窗口；取消丢弃未应用改动。底部保存更改提交当前表格草稿，还原更改恢复基线。更改格使用标记并显示待保存数量。切换字段不会静默提交。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KyX1F",
          "name": "类型和完整值",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "类型和完整值",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hf9gU",
          "name": "类型和完整值 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "文本、JSON 与 Hex / Base64 根据字段类型提供编辑器。JSON / 二进制需有效才可应用。允许 NULL 的字段有显式 NULL 开关，空串不转 NULL。未完整读取的大值先加载完整值；超限时提供只读查看而非编辑截断数据。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Isz7v",
          "name": "允许编辑的依据",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "允许编辑的依据",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TJ9pd",
          "name": "允许编辑的依据 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "表格或 SQL 结果需要单一可验证基表来源、完整稳定主键和实际 UPDATE 权限。表达式、聚合、多表联接、无法定位主键或只读字段只查看。不会从展示文案、SQL 字符串猜测或列别名决定编辑目标。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wp1e1",
          "name": "提交与冲突",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "提交与冲突",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Y3XV73",
          "name": "提交与冲突 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "只保存已修改字段，使用完整行键及原值 / 版本校验避免覆盖并发修改；原值比较保留真实类型和字节语义。支持的事务内提交更改，失败保留草稿。冲突展示读取时原值、当前值和草稿，不自动强制覆盖。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gjZ34",
          "name": "保存结果未知",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "保存结果未知",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PrW76",
          "name": "保存结果未知 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "已发出的保存在断线 / 超时后不能确认结果时，显示保存结果未知，保留草稿并阻止盲重试。重新连接后核对原始目标行，用户决定后续操作；取消不承诺数据库已回滚。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WrcOc",
          "name": "离开与恢复",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "离开与恢复",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "g6xchO",
          "name": "离开与恢复 内容",
          "fill": "$body",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "有草稿时关闭表 / SQL 结果标签、刷新、切换数据库或重跑查询，先选择保存 / 放弃 / 取消。字段窗口校验失败、保存失败均不丢输入。应用后恢复原单元格焦点与滚动位置。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
